            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/update",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "update"]
            },
            "description": "**PUT /api/mobile/partner/update** — first-time onboarding\n\n- **multipart/form-data** (do not set Content-Type manually)\n- **Bearer** `{{token}}`\n\nSets `users.franchise_id` from state/city/area.\n\n**bank_account:** JSON **array** in this example (2 accounts). Use a **single object** to upsert one account only.\n\n**partner_services:** If `{{categoryId}}` / `{{serviceId}}` are empty, run Catalog after this update, then use **Update partner (multiple banks & services)**.\n\nSelect **image** and **aadhar_card** files before Send."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Catalog",
          "description": "Bearer required. Run **after** full Update (partner needs `franchise_id`). Order: Categories → Services.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Categories",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const rec = j?.records?.[0];",
                      "  if (rec?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', String(rec._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
                },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/categories",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "categories"]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/categories**\n\n- **400** if no `franchise_id` — complete location on Update first\n- **200** `records`: `_id`, `name`, `desc`, `image_url`\n- Tables: users → franchises → categories"
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Services",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const rec0 = j?.records?.[0];",
                      "  const rec1 = j?.records?.[1];",
                      "  if (rec0?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceId', String(rec0._id));",
                      "  if (rec1?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceId2', String(rec1._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
                },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/services?category_id={{categoryId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "services"],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "category_id",
                      "value": "{{categoryId}}",
                      "description": "Required — 24-hex ObjectId"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/services?category_id=**\n\n- **400** `category_id is required.` / invalid format\n- **404** `Category not found.`\n- **403** not available for franchise\n- Sets `{{serviceId}}`, `{{serviceId2}}` (if 2+ records)"
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
