                  "value": "[{\"category_id\":\"{{categoryId}}\",\"services\":[{\"service_id\":\"{{serviceId}}\",\"description\":\"Home cleaning\",\"price\":499},{\"service_id\":\"{{serviceId2}}\",\"description\":\"Deep cleaning\",\"price\":799}]}]",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Multiple services under one category — run Services first for serviceId2"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/update",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "update"]
            },
            "description": "**PUT /api/mobile/partner/update** — partial (catalog + banks)\n\nRun **after** Categories + Services so `{{categoryId}}`, `{{serviceId}}`, `{{serviceId2}}` are set.\n\n- **bank_account** array → replaces all accounts in `bank_account` collection\n- **partner_services** → multiple services in one category\n\nNo files required for this partial update."
          },
          "response": []
